        <item>
            <title>0.18.19</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 07:43:48 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>0.18.19</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.18.19</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in 0.18.19</h2>
<ul>
<li>**Starter links wear their favicons** — the Websites folder&#x27;s Apple, YouTube, Wikipedia and Google pills show the site&#x27;s icon.</li>
<li>**Folder pills sit centred** — pills you never placed by hand, window pills and a new user&#x27;s starter folders sit round the folder&#x27;s spoke, nearest its outward line, instead of filling from one side. Two windows now sit side by side on the line instead of either side of an empty seat.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
